00:07:59.545 --> 00:08:00.746
- Right, it's insane.

00:08:00.746 --> 00:08:02.548 align:start size:84% position:16%
I mean, David Duke
could write this shit.

00:08:02.548 --> 00:08:03.783
I mean, he really could.

00:08:03.783 --> 00:08:05.284
I mean, David Duke
could write the idea

00:08:05.284 --> 00:08:08.154
that whiteness is about hard
work and individual initiative

00:08:08.154 --> 00:08:10.690
