would be the result.

00:08:23.069 --> 00:08:24.403 align:start size:88% position:13%
I mean, that's insanely
dangerous stuff,

00:08:24.403 --> 00:08:26.272
but because the charge of racism

00:08:26.272 --> 00:08:28.841 align:start size:81% position:19%
is the most highly
charged charge

00:08:28.841 --> 00:08:30.309
