00:08:30.309 --> 00:08:31.310 align:start size:97% position:3%
It's the worst thing you
can call somebody in America

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:32.578
and for good reason,

00:08:32.578 --> 00:08:34.280
because that is an
awful thing to be.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.448
And it's an awful thing
to say about somebody,

00:08:35.448 --> 00:08:36.749
it's an awful thing to be.

00:08:36.749 --> 00:08:39.719
Because that is such
a highly loaded term,

00:08:39.719 --> 00:08:41.854 align:start size:84% position:16%
it's so easy to cudgel
people into line.

00:08:41.854 --> 00:08:43.623
All you have to do
is just to acquiesce.

00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:45.258
All you'd have to
do is be the person

00:08:45.258 --> 00:08:46.559
