00:13:21.033 --> 00:13:22.601
When she's not explaining

00:13:22.601 --> 00:13:23.869 align:start size:84% position:16%
that people are
shooting each other

00:13:23.869 --> 00:13:25.371 align:start size:97% position:3%
in the inner city for bread.
