00:13:29.742 --> 00:13:31.310 align:start size:84% position:16%
I say to my wife,
are we out of cereal?

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:32.778
She says, yes.

00:13:32.778 --> 00:13:34.280
And I immediately go and
