00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:37.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's the way I deal with
my own personal hanger.

00:13:37.049 --> 00:13:39.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
But when she's not saying
that sort of stuff,

00:13:39.185 --> 00:13:42.321 align:start size:97% position:3%
this is becoming a very
