00:14:03.576 --> 00:14:05.044
- You're a sci-fi guy,

00:14:05.044 --> 00:14:07.413 align:start size:94% position:6%
do you sort of admire
the beauty of their evil?

00:14:07.413 --> 00:14:08.247
(laughing)

00:14:08.247 --> 00:14:09.481
You know what I mean?

00:14:09.481 --> 00:14:10.983
Really at some level
to create a system

00:14:10.983 --> 00:14:15.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
that proves itself, in and
of itself is the proof.

00:14:15.187 --> 00:14:17.256 align:start size:97% position:3%
Like there's a certain beauty
to that as evil as it is.

00:14:17.256 --> 00:14:18.724
- It's super clever.

00:14:18.724 --> 00:14:20.759 align:start size:97% position:3%
I mean, the argument is
completely circular, right?

00:14:20.759 --> 00:14:22.361
They just say you're
a racist and you say,

00:14:22.361 --> 00:14:23.963
"Well, but you have no
evidence of my racism."

00:14:23.963 --> 00:14:25.731 align:start position:0%
They say, "Well, you don't even
recognize your own racism."

00:14:25.731 --> 00:14:27.466
You say, "Well then
how am I racist?"

00:14:27.466 --> 00:14:29.235
They said, "Because
you're complicit in
a system of racism."

00:14:29.235 --> 00:14:31.237
See, right, but the
system isn't racist,

00:14:31.237 --> 00:14:32.905
like you can't point to
something that's racist.

00:14:32.905 --> 00:14:35.174
No, but it results
in racial inequality

00:14:35.174 --> 00:14:36.675
and therefore it
is a racist system

00:14:36.675 --> 00:14:38.077
and therefore you are
complicit in the system

00:14:38.077 --> 00:14:39.612
and therefore you're a racist.

00:14:39.612 --> 00:14:41.213
And you say, okay, well,

00:14:41.213 --> 00:14:43.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
but all systems perpetuate
racial inequality.

