00:23:23.902 --> 00:23:25.437
Whichever you prefer.

00:23:25.437 --> 00:23:27.672
And the idea is that those
are discoverable in nature

00:23:27.672 --> 00:23:28.874
using our reason.

00:23:28.874 --> 00:23:30.342
Those would be the
right to free speech,

00:23:30.342 --> 00:23:32.911 align:start position:0%
the right to practice religion,
the right to life, liberty,

00:23:32.911 --> 00:23:33.879
