- Right, so this is the
countervailing vision of-

00:24:49.221 --> 00:24:50.155 line:0%
- Oh, should we wait?

00:24:50.155 --> 00:24:51.389 line:0%
We're doing chapter one, right?

00:24:51.389 --> 00:24:52.791 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
- Yeah.
- Okay, keep going.

00:24:52.791 --> 00:24:55.260 line:0%
- And all of these
kind of root beliefs,

00:24:55.260 --> 00:24:57.229
rights that preexist government,

00:24:57.229 --> 00:24:59.264
the idea that all men
are created equal,

00:24:59.264 --> 00:25:00.765 align:start size:84% position:16%
and there's an
equality before law,

00:25:00.765 --> 00:25:03.001
the idea that the government
