The idea that there are
checks and balances,

00:25:29.127 --> 00:25:30.996 align:start size:97% position:3%
because if I'm given ultimate
power, I can be a tyrant.

00:25:30.996 --> 00:25:32.497 align:start size:97% position:3%
If you're given ultimate
