00:25:39.137 --> 00:25:42.974 align:start size:84% position:16%
And then the idea
that, so subsidiarity,

00:25:42.974 --> 00:25:44.309
the idea of checks and balances

00:25:44.309 --> 00:25:45.644 align:start size:81% position:19%
and the idea of
