00:26:18.143 --> 00:26:19.611
So the idea in American history

00:26:19.611 --> 00:26:22.013
is that these founding
principles were good,

00:26:22.013 --> 00:26:23.815
great, they're universal,

00:26:23.815 --> 00:26:25.183 align:start size:88% position:13%
and that we've not
always lived up to them.

00:26:25.183 --> 00:26:26.718 align:start size:88% position:13%
And the story of America
is about human beings

00:26:26.718 --> 00:26:27.953
