college campuses?

01:17:22.604 --> 01:17:24.072
And I was like,

01:17:24.072 --> 01:17:25.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause it's not gonna
stay on college campuses.

01:17:25.574 --> 01:17:28.043
And people said, no, they'll
get out in the real world.

01:17:28.043 --> 01:17:29.211
And then they'll
have to be hired.

01:17:29.211 --> 01:17:30.679
They'll have to work a job.

01:17:30.679 --> 01:17:32.147
They'll have to learn to
get along in the workplace.

01:17:32.147 --> 01:17:34.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
What if they bend the
real world to their will?

01:17:34.049 --> 01:17:36.385 align:start position:0%
What if the person who
graduated the journalism program

01:17:36.385 --> 01:17:37.819
at NYU goes onto
the New York Times,

01:17:37.819 --> 01:17:40.122 align:start size:84% position:16%
and isn't inculcated
into a culture

01:17:40.122 --> 01:17:41.556
that values freedom of speech,

01:17:41.556 --> 01:17:43.392
but is granted the
keys to the kingdom

01:17:43.392 --> 01:17:45.460
and told it's your
turns to redefine

01:17:45.460 --> 01:17:48.664
the meaning of journalism
and that's what's happened.

01:17:48.664 --> 01:17:50.666 align:start size:84% position:16%
And the right
basically did nothing.

01:17:50.666 --> 01:17:52.668
The entire ship of state has
been listening to the left.

01:17:52.668 --> 01:17:56.204 align:start size:97% position:3%
And meanwhile, the Republicans
are running up the slope,

01:17:56.204 --> 01:17:58.907
